Halo.

551
00:50:35,500 --> 00:50:36,708
Siapa namamu?

552
00:50:36,792 --> 00:50:38,417
Aku baru memanggilnya Cantik.

553
00:50:39,375 --> 00:50:40,375
Cantik.

554
00:50:41,625 --> 00:50:42,875
Salam kenal.

555
00:50:43,375 --> 00:50:44,667
Menakjubkan.

556
