Kurasa kita harus luncurkan.

562
00:53:37,708 --> 00:53:38,625
Nora!

563
00:53:38,708 --> 00:53:40,042
Lari!

564
00:54:14,833 --> 00:54:15,833
Ayo!

565
00:54:19,542 --> 00:54:20,708
Ayo!

566
00:54:24,958 --> 00:54:26,125
Ayo!

