Lihat.

666
01:03:54,792 --> 01:03:56,208
Aku akan coba pakai ini.

667
01:04:09,417 --> 01:04:11,042
Nora! Ini!

668
01:04:12,667 --> 01:04:15,042
Ya, pertama… Pertama, di paha.

669
01:04:16,125 --> 01:04:18,083
Lalu tombak di perut.

670
